OL,3,GNEWSABoxing and wrestling plans for
OL,4,AYork stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FYork's LNER Community Stadium has
OL,7,Fapplied to be able to host boxing and
OL,8,Fwrestling matches, outside the normal
OL,9,Fsporting seasons.
OL,11,FThey are among a number of events
OL,12,Fproposed in a licensing application for
OL,13,Fthe site, which is home to York City
OL,14,FFC, York Knights and York Valkyrie.
OL,16,FIf approved it would allow the
OL,17,Foperator, York Stadium Management
OL,18,FCompany, to also host music events and
OL,19,Fdance performances.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
