OL,3,GNEWSABoxing and wrestling plans for
OL,4,AYork stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe application to City of York Council
OL,7,Fstates that the events would be held up
OL,8,Fto three days a year, during May and
OL,9,FJune.
